{"type":"text","timestamp":1794320950577,"sessionID":"ses_e3a41d65effemux8cUgF91MmA0","part":{"id":"prt_1c5dc71fb001NyuzbBHddKdNh7","messageID":"msg_1c5dc4f1c001nZ2kjAQR3ESvWr","sessionID":"ses_e3a41d65effemux8cUgF91MmA0","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a persistent image gallery with a Flask JSON API under `/api` and a responsive React/TypeScript frontend styled with Tailwind.\n- Anyone can browse/view images; bearer-authenticated users upload PNG/JPEG as JSON base64 and delete only their own uploads.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace: `/workspace`. Stack: Python 3.13, Flask, SQLite under `./data`, React, TypeScript, Vite.\n- Preserve root `Dockerfile`, `backend/app.py` entry (`app:app`), port 8000, frontend build at `frontend/dist`, and `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Required image fields: `id`, `filename`, `title`, `content_type`, `size_bytes`, `uploaded_at`, `url`, `uploader`.\n- List response: `{\"items\":[...],\"total\":n,\"page\":n,\"page_size\":n}`, newest first.\n- Image format must come from actual content, duplicate filenames remain separate images, stored bytes must be unchanged.\n- Storage decision: `./data/gallery.sqlite3` contains metadata and original image-file BLOBs in separate tables; foreign-key cascading makes uploads/deletions transactional without orphaned files.\n- Authentication: hashed passwords, SHA-256 hashes of random bearer tokens, persistent 30-day sessions. Username is case-insensitively unique, 1–32 ASCII letters/numbers/dots/underscores/hyphens; password length 1–256.\n- Upload limits: 15 MB and 40 million pixels. Pillow verifies and loads PNG/JPEG content without re-encoding.\n- Design: “Folio,” warm cream background, rust accent, sage SVG landscape hero, editorial typography. Local bundled DM Sans and Instrument Serif; no external image/font services.\n- Use Tailwind utilities; only handwritten stylesheet is Tailwind entry `frontend/src/index.css`.\n- Package-cache endpoints failed; installation succeeded using `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` and `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple`.\n- `python` is unavailable; use `python3`. No Docker executable was found, so container build has not been verified.\n- Newly created `/workspace/AGENTS.md` documents stack/check commands and preservation requirements.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Implemented account registration/login, bearer authentication, public image list/detail/file endpoints, authenticated uploads, owner-only deletion, and health endpoint.\n- Added `/api/auth/me` and `/api/auth/logout`; optional list filters `q` and `uploader`.\n- Added JSON API errors, validation, security headers/CSP, SQLite WAL, and persistent sessions.\n- Frontend supports registration/sign-in/sign-out, username display, upload preview/dropzone, API error messages, responsive grid, compact-grid toggle, search, My uploads, pagination, loading/error/empty states, image modal, and deletion confirmation.\n- Native `<dialog>` handles focus containment, Escape dismissal, backdrop clicks, and scroll locking.\n- Updated dependency manifests/locks, favicon, HTML metadata, README, `.gitignore`, and `.dockerignore`.\n- Installed `pillow==12.2.0`; backend requirements constraints successfully installed, including `gunicorn==26.2.0`.\n- Added eight backend unittest cases covering auth, unchanged bytes/content detection, metadata, duplicates/paging/search, owner-only deletion/file removal, invalid inputs, oversized uploads, and persistence across app restart.\n- Verification passed before the latest tiny patch:\n  - `python3 -m unittest backend.test_app -v` — all eight tests passed.\n  - `python3 -m ruff check backend` — passed.\n  - `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build` — passed.\n  - `npm audit --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` — zero vulnerabilities after overriding `minimatch` to `^11.0.5`.\n- Real Chromium browser checks passed for registration, login/logout, upload preview, content detection, unchanged bytes, search, public viewing, persisted token validation, My uploads, delete confirmation/cancellation/deletion, and Escape dismissal.\n- Separate mobile check passed at 390×844: no horizontal overflow, dialog fits viewport, usable auth input, Escape dismissal.\n- Browser verification tools/data/screenshots live only in ignored `frontend/node_modules/.browser-check/`, not project dependencies.\n\n### Active\n- Final verification/cleanup remains; todo “Run tests, typecheck, lint, and production build” is still `in_progress`.\n- Latest patch has not yet been rechecked:\n  - `backend/app.py`: timestamps now use `datetime.now(UTC).isoformat(timespec=\"microseconds\")`; original filename stored unchanged instead of `.strip()`.\n  - `frontend/src/components/AuthForm.tsx`: changed nonexistent “favorites” wording to “your own perspectives.”\n- Current `frontend/dist` predates that last frontend wording change.\n\n### Blocked\n- Docker build cannot be run in this sandbox because Docker is unavailable.\n- Screenshot files were generated, but visual screenshot inspection was unavailable; layout verified programmatically.\n- Temporary packaged Chromium hangs on reload/new-page or viewport-change flows. Browser suite worked around this with persisted-token/API validation and a separate fresh mobile process; actual browser reload restoration was not conclusively tested. Backend restart persistence tests passed.\n- `ruff format --check backend` has not been established as passing; formatting is not part of the documented required checks.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run final checks from `/workspace`: `python3 -m unittest backend.test_app -v`, `python3 -m ruff check backend`, `git diff --check`; from `/workspace/frontend`: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`, optionally `npm audit --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org`.\n2. Review `git status --short`/diff, mark verification todo complete, then provide a concise completion response summarizing implementation and passed checks without claiming a Docker build or verified browser reload.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete API, `create_app(config=None)`, exported `app`, SQLite schema/auth/storage/security/frontend serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_app.py`: `GalleryTests`, eight unittest cases.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt` and `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned backend dependencies/constraints.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: gallery state, session restoration, API fetching, paging/search, dialogs, overall Folio layout.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: `GalleryImage`, `ImagePage`, `Session`, `ApiError`, `api<T>`, token persistence, date/size helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/AuthForm.tsx`: login/register forms; latest wording patch here.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/UploadForm.tsx`: file selection/dropzone, object-URL preview, base64 upload, error handling.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/ImageViewer.tsx`: full-size viewer, metadata, original-file link, confirmed owner deletion.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Modal.tsx`: native dialog and focus/scroll behavior.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Landscape.tsx`: self-contained illustrated hero SVG.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind import/theme/base/components; no other authored CSS.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`: React entry and locally bundled font imports.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json` and `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: dependencies, scripts, `minimatch` override.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/eslint.config.js`, `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: strict typechecking, lint, React/Tailwind plugins, `/api` development proxy.\n- `/workspace/frontend/index.html`, `/workspace/frontend/public/favicon.svg`: Folio metadata/favicon.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: unchanged multistage Node/Python build, gunicorn on port 8000.\n- `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/AGENTS.md`: run/development/check commands and architecture.\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: exclude runtime data, dependencies, build outputs, caches.\n- `/workspace/frontend/node_modules/.browser-check/check.mjs` and `check-mobile.mjs`: temporary ignored browser checks; invoke with `TMPDIR=/workspace/frontend/node_modules/.browser-check node <script-path>`.","time":{"start":1794320921083,"end":1794320950542}}}
